{"name":"Delhumide","status":"ok","title":"Delhumide","pageId":16505,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"dablink\" style=\"padding-left:2em;\"><i>This article is about ruined city of <a href=\"/wiki/Thay\" title=\"Thay\">Thay</a>. For the tharch of the same name, see <a href=\"/wiki/Delhumide_(tharch)\" title=\"Delhumide (tharch)\">Delhumide (tharch)</a>.</i></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Delhumide\" title=\"Category:Maps of Delhumide\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Delhumide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thay\" title=\"Thay\">Thay</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a class=\"newcategory\" href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Delhumide\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Delhumide\">Inhabitants of  Delhumide</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX0RlbGh1bWlkZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Category:Locations in Delhumide (page does not exist)\">Locations in  Delhumide</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9EZWxodW1pZGU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Delhumide (page does not exist)\">Organizations in  Delhumide</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Delhumide&amp;DPL_cat2=Settlements&amp;action=purge\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Settlements  in  Delhumide</a></span></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Delhumide</b> was a city in the <a href=\"/wiki/Delhumide_(tharch)\" title=\"Delhumide (tharch)\">tharch of the same name</a>, located in northeastern <a href=\"/wiki/Thay\" title=\"Thay\">Thay</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-S:CG-p10_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S:CG-p10-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delhumide?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When Thay had been a <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorandi</a> colony, around 1000 years before <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Dale_Reckoning\" title=\"Dale Reckoning\">Dale Reckoning</a>, Delhumide was one of its greatest cities and bastions of power. When the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Red_Wizards\" title=\"Red Wizards\">Red Wizards</a> rebelled, they destroyed the town, using the darkest sort of sorcery to accomplish their task.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-U-p132_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-U-p132-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In <a href=\"/wiki/1375_DR\" title=\"1375 DR\">1375 DR</a>, the ground where the city's ruins still stood was still unclean. <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Demons\" title=\"Demons\">Demons</a> walked there and a man could suffer from madness or leprosy just by venturing there.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-U-p132_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-U-p132-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Shattered battlements and toppled towers could be seen though many of the buildings remained essentially intact.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-U-p170_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-U-p170-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delhumide?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i> <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delhumide?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Novels</dt>\n<dd><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Crimson_Gold\" title=\"The Crimson Gold\">The Crimson Gold</a></i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delhumide?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-S:CG-p10-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-S:CG-p10_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Anthony_Pryor\" title=\"Anthony Pryor\">Anthony Pryor</a> (June 1995). “Campaign Guide”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Michele_Carter\" title=\"Michele Carter\">Michele Carter</a